  "question": {
    "text": "If the mean and variance of the following data:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
